  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenue... Au Coucou.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00760065006E00750065002E002E002E00200041007500200043006F00750063006F0075002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Notre café est un lieu mélancolique où résonne,\ncomme son nom l’indique, le cri du coucou.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a longtemps, notre clientèle a soudainement\naugmenté au point que nous n’arrivions plus<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nà servir tout le monde...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand on doit courir partout pour satisfaire\ntout le monde, le surmenage n’est jamais loin...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais d’un autre côté, sans clients,\nil faudrait fermer boutique.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDans la vie, tout est une question d’équilibre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous voyez où je veux en venir, n’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200076006F00790065007A0020006F00F90020006A00650020007600650075007800200065006E002000760065006E00690072002C0020006E2019006500730074002D0063006500200070006100730020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai aucune idée de ce dont vous parlez.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190061006900200061007500630075006E006500200069006400E9006500200064006500200063006500200064006F006E007400200076006F007500730020007000610072006C0065007A002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Écoutez, je ne lis pas dans les pensées.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C90063006F007500740065007A002C0020006A00650020006E00650020006C006900730020007000610073002000640061006E00730020006C00650073002000700065006E007300E900650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pourtant simple : j’ai besoin de concocter\nun menu qui nous attirera une clientèle fidèle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmais limitée, pour pouvoir souffler un peu.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qui marcherait avec cette idée en tête,\nd’après vous ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500690020006D0061007200630068006500720061006900740020006100760065006300200063006500740074006500200069006400E9006500200065006E0020007400EA00740065002C000A0064201900610070007200E8007300200076006F007500730020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... Des Galettes Illumis ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E0020004400650073002000470061006C0065007400740065007300200049006C006C0075006D006900730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez pensé aux croissants ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A002000700065006E007300E90020006100750078002000630072006F0069007300730061006E007400730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aime bien le riz au curry.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069006D00650020006200690065006E0020006C0065002000720069007A002000610075002000630075007200720079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Des Galettes Illumis ? On en trouve partout.\nBonjour l’originalité...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650073002000470061006C0065007400740065007300200049006C006C0075006D006900730020003F0020004F006E00200065006E002000740072006F00750076006500200070006100720074006F00750074002E000A0042006F006E006A006F007500720020006C2019006F0072006900670069006E0061006C0069007400E9002E002E002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non. Je doute qu’on puisse servir de meilleurs\ncroissants que ceux du Néo Café...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai entendu dire que l’Hôtel Z sert un curry\noriginal. J’aimerais éviter la comparaison...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et les sushis... Que pensez-vous des sushis ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006C006500730020007300750073006800690073002E002E002E0020005100750065002000700065006E00730065007A002D0076006F00750073002000640065007300200073007500730068006900730020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est léger, mais ça ne va pas du tout avec\nune tasse de café.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCe serait parfait pour attirer des gens,\nmais pas trop de monde non plus !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comme quoi, quand je veux, je peux avoir\ndes idées brillantes !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065002000710075006F0069002C0020007100750061006E00640020006A006500200076006500750078002C0020006A006500200070006500750078002000610076006F00690072000A00640065007300200069006400E9006500730020006200720069006C006C0061006E0074006500730020002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai un petit problème, par contre...\nJe n’ai jamais fait de sushis.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200075006E002000700065007400690074002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D0065002C002000700061007200200063006F006E007400720065002E002E002E000A004A00650020006E2019006100690020006A0061006D006100690073002000660061006900740020006400650020007300750073006800690073002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et je n’irai pas en goûter chez Sushi Sans Chichis,\npour voir comment ils les font. Cet endroit est<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhors de prix ! Vous voyez où je veux en venir, là ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, bien sûr vous ne comprenez rien,\nvu la tête que vous faites.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPuisqu’il faut tout vous expliquer : montrez-moi\nle Pokémon Nigirigon sous ses trois formes !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça y est, vous avez un Nigirigon à me montrer ?\nQuelle forme est-ce ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C70061002000790020006500730074002C00200076006F007500730020006100760065007A00200075006E0020004E006900670069007200690067006F006E002000E00020006D00650020006D006F006E00740072006500720020003F000A005100750065006C006C006500200066006F0072006D00650020006500730074002D006300650020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Forme Courbée.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200046006F0072006D006500200043006F00750072006200E90065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Forme Affalée.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200046006F0072006D006500200041006600660061006C00E90065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Forme Raide.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200046006F0072006D0065002000520061006900640065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai rien à vous montrer.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E2019006100690020007200690065006E002000E000200076006F007500730020006D006F006E0074007200650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous croyez que je n’ai pas les yeux en face des\ntrous ? Ce n’est pas la forme dont vous parlez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne sais pas ce que vous essayez de suggérer,\nmais ceci n’est pas un Nigirigon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, c’est ça, un Nigirigon Forme Courbée... ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa ne va pas être facile de s’en inspirer, mais bon,\nje peux toujours prendre des notes. Merci.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela m’a été bien utile. Vous avez un autre\nNigirigon à me montrer ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006C00610020006D20190061002000E9007400E90020006200690065006E0020007500740069006C0065002E00200056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200075006E002000610075007400720065000A004E006900670069007200690067006F006E002000E00020006D00650020006D006F006E00740072006500720020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Nigirigon Forme Affalée...\nBien sûr, il est important que le poisson du sushi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsoit de première fraîcheur. Mais je prends note !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela m’a été bien utile. Vous avez un autre\nNigirigon à me montrer ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006C00610020006D20190061002000E9007400E90020006200690065006E0020007500740069006C0065002E00200056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200075006E002000610075007400720065000A004E006900670069007200690067006F006E002000E00020006D00650020006D006F006E00740072006500720020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, un Nigirigon Forme Raide, c’est comme ça ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe n’ai donc qu’à mettre un truc en équilibre sur\nle machin, et voilà, ça fera l’affaire. Je note.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela m’a été bien utile. Vous avez un autre\nNigirigon à me montrer ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006C00610020006D20190061002000E9007400E90020006200690065006E0020007500740069006C0065002E00200056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200075006E002000610075007400720065000A004E006900670069007200690067006F006E002000E00020006D00650020006D006F006E00740072006500720020003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vous suis très reconnaissante de m’avoir\nmontré les trois formes de Nigirigon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais essayer d’improviser un plateau de sushis\npour voir. Attendez un instant.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, qu’en pensez-vous ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOn voit que ça a été fait par quelqu’un qui n’y\nconnaît rien, mais c’est bien ça qui donne envie<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nd’en commander un pour voir ce que ça vaut.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça devrait se vendre un peu, mais on ne risque\npas d’ameuter trop de monde comme ça.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’y. Crois. Pas !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190079002E002000430072006F00690073002E00200050006100730020002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Des SUSHIS pour accompagner le CAFÉ ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650073002000530055005300480049005300200070006F007500720020006100630063006F006D007000610067006E006500720020006C0065002000430041004600C90020003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette audace, c’est incroyable !\nY’a qu’à Illumis qu’on voit ce genre de tendance !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zéro chance que je mange un truc pareil...\nPar contre, obligée de partager sur les réseaux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salut, c’est Buzzie, la reine du buzz !\nJ’ai encore trouvé une dinguerie à Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regardez ça ! Des SUSHIS avec du CAFÉ !\nÇa vous dit de tester un truc aussi chelou ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAlors, rendez-vous Au Coucou ! J’ai hâte de lire\nvos réactions dans les commentaires !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Han, je suis vraiment in-co-rri-gi-ble.\nJ’ouvre la bouche et hop, je change le monde.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est trop dur d’être moi, j’ai pas demandé\nà être la reine du web comme ça !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 8132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, regarde ! C’est là qu’on sert des sushis\navec du café !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 8476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C00200072006500670061007200640065002000210020004320190065007300740020006C00E00020007100752019006F006E0020007300650072007400200064006500730020007300750073006800690073000A0061007600650063002000640075002000630061006600E9002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bonjour ! Un café-sushis, s’il vous plaît !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 8596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E006A006F007500720020002100200055006E002000630061006600E9002D007300750073006800690073002C0020007320190069006C00200076006F0075007300200070006C006100EE0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faudrait trouver un nom plus court, parce que je\nvais commander ça tous les jours. Sufé ? Cashi ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nooon !!! On a encore plus de clients qu’avant !\nJe ne vais jamais pouvoir buller sur ma chaise !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
